---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About TILERSHUB | Sri Lanka's Tiling Platform"
  description="Learn about TILERSHUB – Sri Lanka's trusted platform connecting homeowners with certified, professional tilers."
>
  <Header />
  <main>
    <div class="page-content">
      <h1>About TILERSHUB</h1>

      <p>TILERSHUB is Sri Lanka's #1 platform connecting homeowners and developers with certified, professional tilers. We believe every tiling project deserves quality craftsmanship and transparent pricing.</p>

      <h3>Our Mission</h3>
      <p>To make quality tiling accessible to everyone in Sri Lanka by building a trusted marketplace of certified professionals with fair, transparent pricing.</p>

      <h3>What We Offer</h3>
      <p>We verify and certify every tiler on our platform, ensuring they meet our high standards of workmanship, reliability and customer service. All listed tilers offer a 1-year warranty on their work.</p>

      <h3>The TILERSHUB Difference</h3>
      <p>Unlike generic directories, TILERSHUB specialises exclusively in tiling. Our proprietary evaluation system scores tilers across customer service, work quality, tools, safety, knowledge and customer feedback.</p>

      <h3>Contact Us</h3>
      <p>WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/94774503744" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">+94 77 450 3744</a></p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
